            "message": "Changed CLI approval behaviour has no tests reaching it, and no test file in the test record exercises it. The changes: headFiles / unitHeadOf add the head json plus its .log.jsonl and feedback sidecars to the check-in and attachment commits; lifecycleOfArtifact routes approve, reject and ackStale through the registry lifecycle; reviewFindings reads readReviewRecordOf. The only CLI tests in the diff (src/cli/__tests__/command.test.ts, src/cli/__tests__/tui.test.ts) just turn their stubs async and are not in the test record. This is the round-1 code-review fix ('the attachment commit keeps the head's log and feedback files, the CLI review uses the registry lifecycle'), and no passing test pins it.",
